\newlabel{tab:app-cells}{{5}{11}{\textbf {Full-data results for every evaluated LongBench cell, Llama-3-8B-Instruct.} Per task: uniform, the rescaled Stage 2 winner (Winner) and NAS-refined (best of the Stage 4 search); bold: best in each column. The number under each task is the winner's natural average budget, at which Stage 1 found it. MOSAIC's final configuration beats uniform in 53 of 57 cells with a Stage 4 search, and the Winner alone in 49 of 60.\relax }{table.caption.11}{}}
